<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Team Rental started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Team Rental started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Team Rental Group Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 22-1/2 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
